*What to expect*

## African drumming entertainment your guests will remember

Our performances bring together solo [djembe](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Djembe), dunun drums and high-energy dancers. Together, they show the rich diversity and feeling of West African rhythm. With an upbeat groove and an unstoppable pulse, the music draws your crowd in from the very first beat.

In addition, every show features traditional rhythms, authentic instruments and eye-catching costumes. So it’s a feast for the eyes as well as the ears.

Our performers include the Muso Foli Kan Drum and Dance Ensemble, led by co-founder [Nathaniel Combs](/about/).
{% /column %}

